+# Apple Silicon (MPS) environment for 4DGS360 training / rendering / evaluation.
+# See https://github.com/Topabaem05/Dropin3d (docs/4dgs360.md). CUDA-only packages from requirements.txt are removed:
+#   RAPIDS (cuML, cuDF, ...), CuPy  -> scikit-learn / NumPy via dropin3d
+#   pytorch3d                        -> exact torch kNN via dropin3d
+#   gsplat==1.5.3 (CUDA)             -> mpsplat, a Metal fork that keeps the `gsplat` package name
+# Recent PyTorch is needed for MPS kernels (e.g. torch.mps.compile_shader used by mpsplat).
